features.what_it_does:
What felt good, judging by what was kept or approved through iterations:
- the latitude-banded particle orb with its bright rim;
- the hero-to-story hand-off of the orb, over 70% of the hero's height;
- the story opening at the visitor's own time, with the blinking outlined clock (8fbf83d);
- greetings leaving the orb on alternating sides, never overlapping (aae4b59);
- the features choreography: the heading hands off to the corner while the tags settle evenly round the orb, breathing together and catching its light (795ba0d, 365749f);
- the live call card (typing → streamed reply → ripple → done chip);
- the warm light that slides along the eclipse rim to whatever plan the agent recommends;
- Lenis at lerp .09;
- the letter resolve (blur 6px → 0 over 1s, random delays up to .9s) and one easing curve;
- the agent moving the page politely (follow pill, 2.5s grace).

features.config_and_data:
Constants worth reusing:
- hand-off smooth(0, .7·heroHeight, scrollY);
- story 420svh, windows [0,.28] [.28,.68] [.68,1.01], snap past a .35 jump;
- τ values: states 250 ms, story 143 ms, opening 83 ms, scene position 200 ms, shape 455 ms, alpha 625 ms, pointer 400 ms;
- idle spin .09 rad/s;
- greetings every 1.05 s, life 2.1 s, slots ±1.75/±1.25 R;
- features pin 260svh, transition at 15–65%, R .30 → .21 of min(vh, .62vw), gap max(28, .2R), breathing ±4px at .9 rad/s;
- call timings: typing 800/1200 ms, 75 ms per word, 900 + 22·chars ms per line, 3000 ms done, ripple 280 px/s over 2.6 s;
- eclipse rise 180px over 90% vh; rim light .9s.

features.port_notes:
For the three new concepts, carry over functions and narrative devices, not layouts:
- the live-time call story;
- the orb as the talk button;
- the agent moving the page and lighting what she recommends;
- details filled in as the visitor talks, with the live ROI;
- the scripted live-call demo with multilingual and RTL proof;
- the greetings.
Every orb needs real 3D handling: drag-rotate with inertia, cursor tilt and parallax, touch drag, arrow keys, and all five voice states plus tone. Drop the glass-pill clusters, the gradient blobs and the three-card pricing grid. The founders' offer ledger replaces the plans, and the two-step application with a HubSpot meeting replaces the demo form.
